<DescriptionTexts>


Movie ratings help you decide the movies that can be played on this console.

Not all movies are encoded with a rating. Unencoded movies are controlled by the Unrated Video control.\0


TV ratings help you decide the TV shows that can be played on this console.

Not all TV shows are encoded with a rating. Unencoded shows are controlled by the Unrated Video control.\0


Decide whether explicit video can be played on this console.

Explicit video is video that is marked as having explicit content.\0


Decide whether unrated DVDs and videos can be played on this console.</DescriptionTexts>
